    "title": "Sabetha man injured in motorcycle-truck crash in Brown County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Phil Anderson ,\n1 days ago SABETHA, Kan. (WIBW) - A motorcycle rider sustained serious injuries in a crash with a pickup truck Monday evening in Brown County, authorities said. The crash was reported at 5:52 p.m. Tuesday on 260th Street about a half-mile east of US-75 highway. The location was on the southeast edge of Sabetha. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
